Redirect 301 /page/10 https://stroikomcompany.ru/objects
Redirect 301 /page/11 https://stroikomcompany.ru/realty
Redirect 301 /page/12 https://stroikomcompany.ru/about
Redirect 301 /page/13 https://stroikomcompany.ru/about
Redirect 301 /page/14 https://stroikomcompany.ru/about
Redirect 301 /page/16 https://stroikomcompany.ru/about
